<dp:is-noreply />
<dp:subject>
	Error with your reply to "{{ subject }}"
</dp:subject>
<dp:body>
	<dp:section>
		Your email reply to ticket #{{ ticket.id }} was missing a marker line that looks like this:
		<br /><br />
		=== {{ phrase('agent.emails.reply_above_line') }} ===
		<br /><br />
		This reply marker is required for proper processing of your replies. Please re-send your reply,
		but this time leave the reply line marker in tact.
	</dp:section>
</dp:body>